config USB_DWC3_AXERA
	tristate "Axera AX630C (AX620E) Platform"
	depends on OF && COMMON_CLK
	default USB_DWC3
	select MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Support USB2 functionality on Axera AX620E-family SoCs (AX630C).
	  The controller is a stock DesignWare USB3 core in a high-speed-only
	  configuration; this glue drives its three clocks, its two software
	  resets and the VBUSVALID indication, all of which live in the SoC's
	  flash system syscon rather than in the core's own register window.

	  Say 'Y' or 'M' if you have one such device.
